  "question": {
    "text": "The terminal velocity of a small sphere of radius $a$ in a viscous liquid is proportional to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2l1VY",
      "text": "\n$a^2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "AfS5F",
      "text": "\n$a^3$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cVyNn",
      "text": "\n$a$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "B1u0h",
      "text": "\n$a^{-1}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Terminal velocity in a viscous medium is given by:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& V_T=\\frac{2 a^2(\\rho-\\sigma) g}{9 \\eta} \\\\\n& \\therefore V_T \\propto a^2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
